{"overview":"در طول یک شب، معابد مرموزی ناگهان ظاهر می‌شوند، پر از Relicهای الهی که قدرت عظیمی می‌دهند و منجر به رقابت جهانی برای تسلط بر آن‌ها می‌شود. در میان این آشوب، یک غارتگر، جوهون سو، خیانت می‌شود و برای مرگ رها می‌شود تا سال‌ها پیش، قبل از ظهور Relicها، فرصتی دوباره برای بازگشت پیدا کند. با طغیان و دانش آینده، او به دنبال غارت هر معبدی است که پیش از آن ظهور کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Chaos ensues overnight when mysterious tombs suddenly surface, filled with divine relics granting overwhelming power, triggering a global power struggle to claim them for dominion. Among the havoc, a raider, Jooheon Suh, is betrayed and left for dead until a second chance brings him back years before the relics. Fueled by fury and future knowledge, he sets out to raid each tomb before they arise.","tagline_en":"Anime","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/1VYDx4K8TYoEaKiBA0FY6UameFx.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["KR","JP","CN"],"cast":[{"name":"황창영","role":"Suh Joo-heon (voice)","photo":"/6SlUgdqSGTfbvoesJIFOHOePR4V.jpg","en":"Hwang Chang-yung"},{"name":"이유리","role":"Irene Holton (voice)","photo":"/6QLQIysqTEXbBcyEOyZmpxfTQEA.jpg","en":"Lee Yu-ri"},{"name":"민응식","role":"Kwon Tae-joon (voice)","photo":"/dCSfPanv1ypOpWBCWhDXXfhcXWX.jpg","en":"Min Eung-sik"},{"name":"심규혁","role":"Jae-Ha Yoo (voice)","photo":"/lBVs5csB5GsUnWjICiDX2W5geDO.jpg","en":"Shim Kyu-hyuck"},{"name":"木暮晃石","role":"Julian Miller (japanse)","photo":"/a4nQ5seWDMMSDzW37MkRpk0ZnTE.jpg","en":"Koseki Kogure"},{"name":"細谷佳正","role":"Goriki Ryoga (voice)","photo":"/lUR5oN1LrqGgp25IOcI1qOH1Ud5.jpg","en":"Yoshimasa Hosoya"},{"name":"سائوری هایامی","role":"Irene Holton (voice)","photo":"/gLv9lO7dlUbIsmyJUvgegqAAXki.jpg","en":"Saori Hayami"},{"name":"入野自由","role":"Yanagi Kotaro (voice)","photo":"/8qEEhHUObNvGQr4e6eqLu5z4qTz.jpg","en":"Miyu Irino"},{"name":"جونیچی سووابه","role":"Ogawara Taisei (voice)","photo":"/4S7c3n3r07A83HvkLrnWZG